{"id": "14-1787-2-10", "zh": "后接呼格词尾（ga）时，凡是 bhavanta 一词都替换为 bho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1788-2-19", "zh": "如 bho purisa、bho aggi、bho rāja、bho sattha、bho daṇḍi、bho sayambhu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-1789-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**ge**”（后接呼格时）？", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-1789-6-9", "zh": "如 bhavatā、bhavaṃ。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-1790-2-18", "zh": "由于规则中用了 tu 一词，在其他词尾中，凡是 bhavanta 一词也替换为 bhonta、bhante、bhonto、bhadde、bhotā、bhoto 这些替代形式。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-1791-2-13", "zh": "如 bhonta、bhante、bhonto、bhadde、bhotā、bhoto。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-1792-2-8", "zh": "244,72. Akārapitādyantānamā（a 音以及 pitā 等词的末音变为 ā）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1793-2-11", "zh": "后接呼格词尾时，a 音以及 pitā 等词的末音都变为 ā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-1794-2-16", "zh": "如 bho purisā、bho rājā、bho pitā、bho mātā、bho satthā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-1795-2-9", "zh": "245,152. Jhalapā rassaṃ（jha、la、pa 变为短音）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1796-2-7", "zh": "后接呼格词尾时，jha、la、pa 这些都变为短音。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-1797-2-12", "zh": "如 bho daṇḍi、bho sayambhu、bhoti itthi、bhoti vadhu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1798-2-10", "zh": "246,73. Ākāro vā（ā 音可以变短）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1799-2-8", "zh": "后接呼格词尾时，ā 音可以变为短音。", "confidence": 84}
{"id": "14-1800-2-25", "zh": "如 bho rāja、bho rājā，bho atta、bho attā，bho sakha、bho sakhā，bho sattha、bho satthā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-1801-2-6", "zh": "以上是名词篇的第四节。", "confidence": 80}
